IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `aia-definitions`
IMPORT `P8-gate`
IMPORT `P8-art74`

-- Tests of Article 74. The group General applies from 2 August 2026 (Art 113); the system below is high-risk under Annex III and placed on
-- 2 December 2027 (not saved by Art 111(2)). Every function is asked on 2 August 2026 and, for the gate, on 1 August 2026.
-- A function with only `the date asked` for system: the group is asked with the keel's constants.

`Art 74 test on` MEANS Date 2 8 2026
`Art 74 test before` MEANS Date 1 8 2026
`Art 74 test route` MEANS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
`Art 74 test placed` MEANS Date 2 12 2027

§ `Art 74(1): Regulation (EU) 2019/1020, economic operators, products`

#ASSERT `Art 74(1) Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 applies to the AI system` `Art 74 test on` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 74(1) Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 applies to the AI system` `Art 74 test on` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 74(1) Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 applies to the AI system` `Art 74 test before` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the six operators of Art 3(8)
#ASSERT `Art 74(1)(a) the party is understood as an economic operator under Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` `Art 74 test on` Provider EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 74(1)(a) the party is understood as an economic operator under Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` `Art 74 test on` Deployer EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 74(1)(a) the party is understood as an economic operator under Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` `Art 74 test on` `Authorised representative` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 74(1)(a) the party is understood as an economic operator under Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` `Art 74 test on` Importer EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 74(1)(a) the party is understood as an economic operator under Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` `Art 74 test on` Distributor EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 74(1)(a) the party is understood as an economic operator under Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` `Art 74 test on` `Product manufacturer` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- not operators: a notified body and an affected person (the text says what is "included"; it does not close the list)
#ASSERT `Art 74(1)(a) the party is understood as an economic operator under Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` `Art 74 test on` `Notified body` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 74(1)(a) the party is understood as an economic operator under Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` `Art 74 test on` `Affected person` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 74(1)(a) the party is understood as an economic operator under Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` `Art 74 test before` Provider EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 74(1)(b) the AI system is understood as a product under Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` `Art 74 test on` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 74(1)(b) the AI system is understood as a product under Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` `Art 74 test on` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 74(1)(b) the AI system is understood as a product under Regulation (EU) 2019/1020` `Art 74 test before` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

