    PARTY `Arts 72 to 79 party market surveillance authority` DOES `Art 74(2) report annually to the Commission about the use of prohibited practices and the measures taken` AT (Day (Date 4 8 2026))
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `Art 74(2) second sentence the market surveillance authorities' duty to report annually about the use of prohibited practices` `Art 74 test on` AT (Day (Date 3 8 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 31 12 2030))
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 74(2) second sentence the market surveillance authorities' duty to report annually about the use of prohibited practices` `Art 74 test before` AT (Day (Date 3 8 2026)) WITH
    WAITUNTIL (Day (Date 31 12 2030))

